### Login del VIP
POST http://jspos-sales.test/api/vip/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "email": "dalbert@gmail.com",
    "password": "123456"
}

### Ver tu Perfil (Requiere el Token devuelto arriba)
GET http://jspos-sales.test/api/vip/me
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 146|EzDzB70FCdxHAZHmGT4y2JVGX9CUpeJkcm0VMm1n44b6f94f

### Logout del VIP
POST http://jspos-sales.test/api/vip/logout
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 146|EzDzB70FCdxHAZHmGT4y2JVGX9CUpeJkcm0VMm1n44b6f94f

### Ver mis Órdenes
GET http://jspos-sales.test/api/vip/orders
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 146|EzDzB70FCdxHAZHmGT4y2JVGX9CUpeJkcm0VMm1n44b6f94f

### Crear una nueva Orden
POST http://jspos-sales.test/api/vip/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 146|EzDzB70FCdxHAZHmGT4y2JVGX9CUpeJkcm0VMm1n44b6f94f

{
    "items": [
        {
            "product_id": 1,
            "quantity": 2,
            "price": 15.00
        }
    ]
}

### Ver logs de una Orden Específica
GET http://jspos-sales.test/api/vip/orders/1/logs
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 146|EzDzB70FCdxHAZHmGT4y2JVGX9CUpeJkcm0VMm1n44b6f94f

### Enviar Orden a la Oficina (Procesamiento final)
POST http://jspos-sales.test/api/vip/orders/1/send
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 146|EzDzB70FCdxHAZHmGT4y2JVGX9CUpeJkcm0VMm1n44b6f94f

### Eliminar / Cancelar una Orden Incompleta
DELETE http://jspos-sales.test/api/vip/orders/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 146|EzDzB70FCdxHAZHmGT4y2JVGX9CUpeJkcm0VMm1n44b6f94f

### Obtener datos para Formulario de Pagos VIP (Bancos y métodos)
GET http://jspos-sales.test/api/vip/payments/form-data
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 146|EzDzB70FCdxHAZHmGT4y2JVGX9CUpeJkcm0VMm1n44b6f94f

### Obtener mis Ventas/Deudas Pendientes
GET http://jspos-sales.test/api/vip/sales/pending
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 146|EzDzB70FCdxHAZHmGT4y2JVGX9CUpeJkcm0VMm1n44b6f94f

### Subir un Pago o Reporte de Transferencia VIP
POST http://jspos-sales.test/api/vip/payments/upload
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 146|EzDzB70FCdxHAZHmGT4y2JVGX9CUpeJkcm0VMm1n44b6f94f

{
    "bank_id": 1,
    "payment_method": "Transferencia",
    "amount": 100.00,
    "reference": "12345678"
}

### Ver Historial de mis Pagos/Reportes (Mis Pagos Subidos)
GET http://jspos-sales.test/api/vip/payments/history
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 146|EzDzB70FCdxHAZHmGT4y2JVGX9CUpeJkcm0VMm1n44b6f94f

### Ver Historial Global de mis Pagos Subidos
GET http://jspos-sales.test/api/vip/payments/history/global
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 146|EzDzB70FCdxHAZHmGT4y2JVGX9CUpeJkcm0VMm1n44b6f94f

### Ver el Catálogo con tus Precios VIP
GET http://jspos-sales.test/api/vip/products
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 146|EzDzB70FCdxHAZHmGT4y2JVGX9CUpeJkcm0VMm1n44b6f94f
